      <h2>Scottish health priorities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Deep Integration:</strong> Linking social care, housing, and NHS boards directly with third-sector community anchors.</li>
        <li><strong>Outdoor &amp; Nature Prescribing:</strong> Harnessing Scotland's natural environment to promote mental wellbeing and active living.</li>
        <li><strong>Tackling Inequalities:</strong> Focusing resources on areas facing severe health disparities to ensure preventative infrastructure reaches all communities.</li>
      </ul>

